The player-movement maths in src/main/java/dev/xashmove/physics/PmCore.java and
XashPhysics.java is a port of pm_shared.c from the Half-Life 1 SDK as shipped in
FWGS hlsdk-portable (the game code Xash3D FWGS runs). That file is
"Copyright (c) 1996-2002, Valve LLC" and its header restricts use to
non-commercial enhancements to Valve products; the HL1 SDK licence allows free,
non-commercial distribution only. Most of the same algorithms (accelerate,
airaccelerate, friction, stopspeed) originate in id Software's QuakeWorld pmove.c,
which is GPL-2.0. Review these terms before publishing this mod publicly.
